{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15732","headline":"迎神 · 司空曙","name":"迎神","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吉日兮临水，沐青兰兮白芷。\n假山鬼兮请东皇，托灵均兮邀帝子。\n吹参差兮正苦，舞婆娑兮未已。\n鸾旌圆盖望欲来，山雨霏霏江浪起。\n神既降兮我独知，目成再拜爲陈词。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15732.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15732","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}